        "TileImage": "$($repository a72ad3c8-89aa-4661-bc46-8b04c244a2a0).Image",
        "Description": "Good evening, 47.\r\rWelcome to Whittleton Creek. Two residents have attracted our attention: Trevor Skinner and Daron Blumberg. Both are suspected of being involved in a small-scale drug distribution network operating quietly within the neighbourhood. What initially appeared to be isolated activity has raised concerns about a growing operation. Your mission is to eliminate both targets and put an end to their business before it expands.\r\rGood hunting, 47.",
